{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a11a1006-4d7e-4b2a-9f11-6e0c1d8a4b06",
    "name": "School API — Admin Contact Messages",
    "description": "Platform-admin contact inbox. **Documented:** `GET /admin/contact-messages`, `POST /admin/contact-messages/:id/act`.\n\n- Both routes require Bearer `{{accessToken}}` **then** `{{adminHost}}`.\n- `requireAdminSession` runs **before** the host check — missing/invalid token is **401** `{ \"error\": \"Unauthorized\" }` even on a school host.\n- Wrong host after a valid admin token: **403** `{ \"error\": \"This action is only allowed on the admin host\" }`.\n- Public `POST /public/contact` is **201** `{ \"ok\": true }` and does **not** return an id. This list writes `{{contactMessageId}}` from the first row.\n\nShared environment: `environments/School-API.local.postman_environment.json`.\n\n- `{{baseUrl}}` is the **backend** (`http://127.0.0.1:5000`), not Next on `3000`.\n- Prefer `x-school-host` over `Host`. Matching lowercases and strips `:{port}`.\n- Tokens are HMAC (`payload.signature`), not JWT. Admin `{{accessToken}}` will not verify on school/campus routes (different HMAC material). School and campus share `:school-account-session`.\n- Error JSON (except health): `{ \"error\": \"<string>\" }`. No 422. Wrapper-only 500 is `{ \"error\": \"Internal server error\" }`.\n- Do not invent routes or status codes. Later batches land in the matching collection file — do not grow a monolith.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:5000"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Admin Contact Messages",
      "description": "Inbox for public contact-form rows. Sign in via **Admin Session** first (`{{accessToken}}`). Host must be `admin.{{rootHost}}` (`{{adminHost}}` = `admin.e-school.et:3000`).\n\nList newest **unacted** first, then newest created. `POST /public/contact` does not return an id — copy `{{contactMessageId}}` from this list. Act is idempotent and needs **no JSON body**.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List admin contact messages",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}",
                "description": "HMAC admin session from POST /admin/session. Missing, non-Bearer, expired, school/campus HMAC, or bad signature → 401 Unauthorized. Checked before the host."
              },
              {
                "key": "x-school-host",
                "value": "{{adminHost}}",
                "description": "Must be admin.<rootHost> after port strip (admin.e-school.et or admin.e-school.et:3000). Checked only after a valid admin token. School / app / apex / Host fallback → 403."
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/contact-messages",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "contact-messages"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "1-based page. Omitted, non-integer, or < 1 → 1. Number(\"\") is 0 and also defaults."
                },
                {
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "50",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Page size. Omitted, non-integer, or < 1 → 50. Integers above 100 are capped at 100."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lists contact-form rows for the platform operator.\n\n**Auth:** required. `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`. `requireAdminSession` / `readPlatformAdminSession` runs **before** method and host checks. Missing header, non-`Bearer ` scheme, empty token, expired, or school/campus HMAC → `401 { \"error\": \"Unauthorized\" }` **even when `x-school-host` is a school host**.\n\n**Who:** the signed-in platform operator. School and campus tokens will not verify (different HMAC material).\n\n**Host (required after auth):** `rejectIfNotAdminHost` / `isPlatformAdminHost`. `x-school-host` (else `Host`) must be `admin.{{rootHost}}` after lowercase + port strip. `{{adminHost}}` = `admin.e-school.et:3000` is valid. School / app / apex / `127.0.0.1` → `403 { \"error\": \"This action is only allowed on the admin host\" }`.\n\n**Query:** `page` (default **1**), `pageSize` (default **50**, max **100**). Handler does `Number(query)`. `normalizeContactPage` / `normalizeContactPageSize`: `undefined`, non-integer (`abc`, `1.5`, `NaN`), or `< 1` (including `0` from `page=`) → defaults. `pageSize` 101 → **100**. Invalid query never 400s.\n\n**Order:** unacted (`actedAt === null`) first, then `createdAt` descending. `pending` is the unacted count across **all** rows, not the page.\n\n**Side effects:** none. Does not mark acted.\n\n**Success `200`:** `{ messages, page, pageSize, total, pending }`. Each message: `{ id, school, name, role, email, note, phone, created, acted }`. `school` is `schoolName`. `name` is `senderName`. `role` / `phone` may be `null`. `created` is ISO-8601 from `createdAt`. `acted` is `actedAt !== null`. Empty inbox is still 200 with `messages: []`, `total: 0`, `pending: 0`.\n\n**Public contact:** `POST /public/contact` returns **201** `{ \"ok\": true }` and **no id**. This request writes `{{contactMessageId}}` from `messages[0].id` when the list is non-empty.\n\n**Errors that exist:** 401 Unauthorized; 403 admin-host only; 405 if not GET (POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE). 405 is reached only **after** a valid admin token.\n\n**Not used:** 400, 404 (path exists), 409, 422. No distinct 500 from this handler."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.test('list is { messages, page, pageSize, total, pending }', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('messages').that.is.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.page).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.pageSize).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.total).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.pending).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    body.messages.forEach(function (message) {",
                  "      pm.expect(message).to.have.property('id').that.is.a('string');",
                  "      pm.expect(message).to.have.property('school').that.is.a('string');",
                  "      pm.expect(message).to.have.property('name').that.is.a('string');",
                  "      pm.expect(message).to.have.property('email').that.is.a('string');",
                  "      pm.expect(message).to.have.property('note').that.is.a('string');",
                  "      pm.expect(message).to.have.property('created').that.is.a('string');",
                  "      pm.expect(message).to.have.property('acted').that.is.a('boolean');",
                  "      pm.expect(message).to.have.property('role');",
                  "      pm.expect(message).to.have.property('phone');",
                  "    });",
                  "  });",
                  "  const first = body.messages[0];",
                  "  if (first && typeof first.id === 'string' && first.id.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('contactMessageId', first.id);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('contactMessageId', first.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
                  "  pm.test('unauthenticated is 401 with Unauthorized', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.eql('Unauthorized');",
                  "  });",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 403) {",
                  "  pm.test('admin host required', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.eql('This action is only allowed on the admin host');",
                  "  });",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 405) {",
                  "  pm.test('method not allowed', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.eql('Method not allowed');",
                  "  });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
